# Ungoogled-Chromium-Windows patches selected for Thorium builds.
#
# This is a curated whitelist of Windows-specific compatibility patches from
# the ungoogled-chromium-windows submodule, plus prerequisite patches from the
# main ungoogled-chromium series that they depend on.
#
# Section markers control the base directory for path resolution:
#   #[windows]  — relative to <submodule>/patches/                (default)
#   #[main]     — relative to <submodule>/ungoogled-chromium/patches/
#
# The following patches from the submodule are intentionally omitted:
#   windows-disable-encryption.patch — depends on ungoogled-only header
#     (ungoogled_platform_flag_entries.h); Thorium has its own patches for the
#     same C++ files (patches/thorium/fixes/components__os_crypt__*.cc.patch).
#   windows-disable-machine-id.patch — same dependency on ungoogled-only header.

